    {
      "sort": -100000,
      "name": "Welcome",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "TU72H3HbSOrR56CR",
      "title": {
        "show": false,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Hello! This is a little module I put together to create a crafting system in Foundry using the <a href=\"https://www.gmbinder.com/share/-MNG6P6I8-1tJM3aroaV\">Potion Crafting and Gathering</a> supplement. This is my first time packaging content up like this, so it'll be a little messy for a while. Regardless, enjoy!</p><p></p><h2>Required modules</h2><ul><li><p>Gatherer for gathering</p><ul><li><p>Better Roll Tables for gathering in quantities</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Mastercrafted for crafting</p></li></ul><p></p><h2>Recommended modules</h2><ul><li><p>midiQOL for automatic rolling of stuff</p></li><li><p>Dynamic Active Effects for applying effects when a player eats a mushroom or drinks a potion</p></li><li><p>Rest Recovery 5e so edible ingredients count towards sating hunger</p><p></p></li></ul><h2>Setup</h2><p>For Gatherer nodes to work, you'll need to import the Potion Crafting and Gathering Tables compendium to your world.</p><p>For crafting, create a placeholder recipe book in Mastercrafted, then right click and import the desired book from the Recipes folder included with this module</p><p></p><h2>Credits</h2><ul><li><p>Content is by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user/posts?u=78783518\">piccolo917</a></p></li><li><p>Gatherer and Mastercrafted modules by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/theripper93/posts\">theripper93</a></p></li><li><p>Nerd work by <a href=\"http://www.actionjay.com/\">action_jay</a></p></li></ul>",
        "markdown": ""
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
